                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Abercrombie to Mr. Dun.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Nagasaki</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1893-12-21"><hi rendition="#italic">December 21,
                        1893</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Will take jurisdiction as advised.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Abercrombie.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
